{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "schinese", "appid": 924970, "month": "2026-03", "window": 4, "start_date": 1774310400, "end_date": 1775001599, "month_true_total": 72, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:10:09 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "222175143", "author": {"steamid": "76561199228579076", "personaname": "LiPP", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199228579076/", "num_games_owned": 17, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 608, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 608, "last_played": 1774962898, "avatar": "a7b145f1140cc3f0e8259a4e86e786d9be686534"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "不如僵尸世界大战一根", "timestamp_created": 1774963000, "timestamp_updated": 1774963000, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222149123", "author": {"steamid": "76561198358698122", "personaname": "逆向", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198358698122/", "num_games_owned": 559, "num_reviews": 131, "playtime_forever": 491, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 491, "last_played": 1775051971, "avatar": "91cadd522bec9515e4486f8ad7d3c313c25f34d5"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "[h1] 游戏性：5/10；手感：7/10；玩法：7/10 [/h1]\n[h2] 优点 [/h2]\n[h3] 1.求生之路升级 [/h3]\n毕竟原班人马，整体求生之路味道很浓，画质枪械进行了升级，作为一个突突突的游戏是合格的。\n[h3] 2.枪械种类，配件 [/h3]\n种类增多再加上配件系统，整个大关之内都会沿用，在单一的流程上面加入了可变换的东西，不会那么枯燥。\n[h3] 3.卡牌系统 [/h3]\n加入了独特的卡牌系统，让游戏变成了一个肉鸽游戏，整体还是比较新颖和有意思的。\n[h2] 缺点 [/h2]\n[h3] 1.游戏bug [/h3]\n不知道是不是我的个人原因，鼠标移动到边缘的时候整个人物会不动，需要把鼠标甩到屏幕中央。\n[h3] 2.没有创意工坊 [/h3]\n求生之路经久不衰的原因有很大一部分原因来自于创意工坊，纵使游戏地图、机制等设计的再好，游戏流程就那么长，摆在那，所以没有创意工坊，很快就会腻。\n[h3] 3.性价比低 [/h3]\n300的价格，这个游戏我觉得不值，需要等打折，联机的代价就更高了，得和朋友一块买，求生之路几块钱那不香吗。\n——————————————————————————————————————————————————\n整体来说，游戏实际上还可以，手感也还好，整体七个章节，但是六七章是DLC，第五章是一个boss关。没有太多剧情，主打一个突突突。但是就这个没有创意工坊再加上它这个定价，让联机变得非常困难，就这几关地图，花好多钱买完之后，打一会就会腻，不太推荐。", "timestamp_created": 1774926625, "timestamp_updated": 1775052869, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222091668", "author": {"steamid": "76561198782520523", "personaname": "不信", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198782520523/", "num_games_owned": 16, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 624, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 368, "last_played": 1779116151, "avatar": "3722e1aded610a56b4d5467b4d3362dbf0746b66"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "\r\n666\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1774867245, "timestamp_updated": 1774867245, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222026712", "author": {"steamid": "76561198315598058", "personaname": "SolanDawn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/solanmeng/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 118, "playtime_forever": 30, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 30, "last_played": 1774